<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<odoo>
 <record id="view_clock_connector_list" model="ir.ui.view"><field name="name">Attendance connectors</field><field name="model">pb.clock.connector</field><field name="arch" type="xml">
  <list><field name="name"/><field name="company_id" groups="base.group_multi_company"/><field name="source_type"/><field name="source_group"/><field name="state"/><field name="last_contact"/><field name="last_read"/><field name="latest_source_punch"/><field name="pending_rows"/></list>
 </field></record>
 <record id="view_clock_connector_form" model="ir.ui.view"><field name="name">Attendance connector setup</field><field name="model">pb.clock.connector</field><field name="arch" type="xml">
 <form string="Attendance data connector">
  <header><button name="action_setup" type="object" string="Guided setup / invite IT" class="btn-primary" groups="hr_attendance.group_hr_attendance_manager"/><button name="action_pair" type="object" string="Replace / manually pair PC" groups="hr_attendance.group_hr_attendance_manager" confirm="Issue a new code? Any previous installation for this connector will need to pair again."/><button name="action_download" type="object" string="Download Windows package" groups="hr_attendance.group_hr_attendance_manager"/><button name="action_records" type="object" string="Received records"/><button name="action_revoke" type="object" string="Revoke installation access" groups="hr_attendance.group_hr_attendance_manager" confirm="Only use this to retire or secure an installation. Data issues never require revoking access."/><field name="state" widget="statusbar"/></header>
  <sheet><div class="alert alert-info">This is the Payobook website. Open this page in a browser on the Windows PC to download and install the connector. Staff continue downloading terminals in Mitaco. The connector reads the local MDB; it does not contact terminals.</div>
  <div class="oe_title"><h1><field name="name" placeholder="Office PC / location"/></h1></div>
  <notebook><page string="Source and schedule"><group><group><field name="company_id"/><field name="source_type"/><field name="source_group"/><field name="tz" string="Time zone"/></group><group><field name="history_from" string="History starts on"/><field name="interval_minutes" string="Sync interval (minutes)"/><field name="code_field" string="Employee code format"/><field name="publish_punches"/></group></group>
  <p>Exact repeats are retained once. Problems appear in Received records and never pause collection. Source groups represent overlapping databases, not verified individual machines. Local database paths and access credentials stay on the PC.</p>
  <p>The Windows setup offers a scheduled task. Keep the PC awake and the configured account signed in, or ask IT to configure the task to run whether that user is logged on or not using Windows Task Scheduler. The connector never asks Payobook to store a Windows password.</p>
  </page><page string="Connection health"><group><group><field name="last_contact"/><field name="last_read"/><field name="latest_source_punch"/><field name="source_rows"/></group><group><field name="pending_rows"/><field name="client_version"/><field name="installation_id"/><field name="invitation_until"/><field name="device_id"/></group></group><field name="last_error"/><p>A successful read only confirms what is in the MDB. It does not confirm that staff have downloaded every terminal.</p></page></notebook></sheet><chatter/>
 </form></field></record>
 <record id="view_connector_pair" model="ir.ui.view"><field name="name">Pair Windows PC</field><field name="model">pb.clock.connector.pair</field><field name="arch" type="xml"><form><group><field name="connector_id"/><field name="code"/></group><p>Copy this one-use code into the installed Windows setup window. It expires in 30 minutes. Use the same Payobook website address as this browser. A pairing code is a credential; do not post it in support messages.</p><footer><button string="Close" special="cancel"/></footer></form></field></record>
 <record id="view_connector_event_list" model="ir.ui.view"><field name="name">Received attendance records</field><field name="model">pb.clock.connector.event</field><field name="arch" type="xml"><list create="0" delete="0" decoration-warning="state == 'review'"><field name="connector_id"/><field name="received_at"/><field name="user_code"/><field name="punch_local_display"/><field name="source_timezone"/><field name="machine_code"/><field name="state"/><field name="note"/></list></field></record>
 <record id="view_connector_event_search" model="ir.ui.view"><field name="name">Search received records</field><field name="model">pb.clock.connector.event</field><field name="arch" type="xml"><search><field name="connector_id"/><field name="user_code"/><filter name="review" string="Needs review" domain="[('state','=','review')]"/><filter name="ready" string="Ready" domain="[('state','=','ready')]"/><filter name="historical" string="Historical / ignored" domain="[('state','=','historical')]"/></search></field></record>
 <record id="view_connector_event_form" model="ir.ui.view"><field name="name">Review source record</field><field name="model">pb.clock.connector.event</field><field name="arch" type="xml"><form create="0" delete="0"><header><button name="action_ignore" type="object" string="Mark historical / ignore" groups="hr_attendance.group_hr_attendance_manager" invisible="state in ['posted', 'duplicate']"/><button name="action_retry" type="object" string="Recheck record" groups="hr_attendance.group_hr_attendance_manager" invisible="state in ['posted', 'duplicate']"/><field name="state" widget="statusbar"/></header><sheet><div class="alert alert-info">Collection continues while you investigate. Raw source data is preserved. Correct an existing attendance day through the normal correction workflow.</div><group><field name="connector_id"/><field name="received_at"/><field name="user_code"/><field name="punch_local_display"/><field name="source_timezone"/><field name="machine_code"/><field name="punch_id"/><field name="note"/><field name="resolution_note"/></group><notebook><page string="Original source"><field name="raw_json"/><field name="row_hash"/></page></notebook></sheet><chatter/></form></field></record>
 <record id="action_clock_connectors" model="ir.actions.act_window"><field name="name">Attendance · Data connectors</field><field name="res_model">pb.clock.connector</field><field name="view_mode">list,form</field><field name="help" type="html"><p class="o_view_nocontent_smiling_face">Connect attendance data from an office PC</p><p>Create a source, download the Windows package on that PC, and pair it. Data issues stay in Payobook for review while uploads continue.</p></field></record>
</odoo>
